{
  "id": "ACT.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ebikolwa byʼAbatume 15",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bayibuli Entukuvu, Endagaano Enkadde nʼEndagaano Empya ekwatiddwa ku katambi™ Obwannannyini© 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 bwa Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" Linnya ery'obwannannyini eryawandiisibwa Biblica mu Amerika era nga balina n'ekkakkalabozo, Inc. Bwaweebwa olukusa okulikozesa. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olukiiko lw'Abakristaayo mu Yerusaalemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ne wajja abantu abamu abaava mu Buyudaaya ne bayigiriza abooluganda nti, \"Ssinga temukomolebwa ng'akalombolombo ka Musa bwe kali temuyinza kulokolebwa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulo ne Balunabba ne bawakana nnyo nabo ku nsonga eyo ne kisalibwawo nti Pawulo ne Balunabba n'abamu ku bakkiriza ab'omu Antiyokiya, batwale ensonga eyo eri abatume n'abakadde b'Ekkanisa mu Yerusaalemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababaka ne bakwata ery'e Yerusaalemi, ne bayimirirako mu kibuga ky'e Fayiniikiya n'e Samaliya okukyalira abakkiriza mu bibuga ebyo n'okubategeeza ng'Abamawanga bangi bwe baakyuka ne bakkiriza. Ebigambo ebyo ne bisanyusa nnyo abooluganda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baatuuka mu Yerusaalemi ne baanirizibwa ekkanisa, abatume n'abakadde b'Ekkanisa bonna. Ne babategeeza byonna Katonda bye yabakozesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abamu ku bakkiriza, ab'omu kibiina ky'Abafalisaayo, ne basituka ne bagamba nti Abaamawanga bonna abakkiriza bateekwa okukomolebwa nga bwe kiri mu mateeka ga Musa, era n'okugoberera obulombolombo bwonna ng'empisa z'Ekiyudaaya bwe ziragira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abatume n'abakadde b'Ekkanisa ne bakuŋŋaana bateese ku nsonga eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluvannyuma nga bateeserezza ebbanga ggwanvu, Peetero n'asituka n'abagamba nti, \"Abooluganda, mwenna mumanyi nga Katonda yannonda dda mu mmwe mu nnaku ezaasooka, mbuulire Enjiri mu baamawanga nabo bakkirize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Katonda amanyi emitima gy'abantu, yayaniriza Abaamawanga ng'abawa Mwoyo Mutukuvu nga naffe bwe yatumuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teyabasosola kubanga bwe baamala okukkiriza, obulamu bwabwe n'abunaaza ng'obwaffe bwe yabunaaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale kaakano, lwaki mwagala okukema Katonda nga mukakaatika ekikoligo mu bulago bw'abayigirizwa, kye mumanyi nga bajjajjaffe kyabakaluubirira era naffe kitukaluubirira okwetikka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tukkiriza nti tulokolebwa lwa kisa kya Mukama waffe Yesu, era n'abamawanga bwe batyo bwe balokolebwa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibiina kyonna ne kisiriikirira ne bawuliriza Balunabba ne Pawulo nga babategeeza eby'amagero n'obubonero Katonda bye yabakozesa nga bali ku mulimu gwe mu baamawanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baamala okwogera, Yakobo n'agamba nti, \"Abasajja abooluganda, mumpulirize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simooni abategeezezza ng'okusookera ddala Katonda bwe yakyalira Abaamawanga ne yeeronderamu abo ab'okuweesa erinnya lye ekitiibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kino kituukiriza bannabbi bye baayogera ng'Ekyawandiikibwa bwe kigamba nti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Oluvannyuma lwa bino ndikomawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 15:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ne nziddaabiriza ennyumba ya Dawudi eyagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ACT 15:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndiddaabiriza ebifo ebyamenyebwamenyebwa. Ndigizaawo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abantu abalala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ACT 15:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "basobole okunoonya Mukama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ACT 15:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "era n'abamawanga be nayita okuba abantu bange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'atyo bw'ayogera Mukama, alaga entegeka ye okuviira ddala ku ntandikwa y'ensi.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Kyenva nsalawo nti, Tetusaana kutikka baamawanga abakkiriza Katonda mugugu munene nga tubawaliriza okukwata obulombolombo bwaffe obw'Ekiyudaaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabula tubawandiikire tubategeeze beewale okulya ennyama eya ssaddaaka eweebwayo eri bakatonda abalala, beewale obwenzi n'okulya ennyama ey'ebisolo ebitugiddwa, era beewale okulya n'omusaayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubanga ebintu byonna biri mu mateeka ga Musa, era bibuulirwa mu makuŋŋaaniro g'Abayudaaya mu buli kibuga buli lunaku lwa Ssabbiiti ebbanga lyonna.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebbaluwa y'Olukiiko eri Abaamawanga Abakkiriza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abatume n'abakadde b'Ekkanisa n'abooluganda bonna mu Kkanisa ne bateesa okutuma ababaka bagende ne Pawulo ne Balunabba mu Antiyokiya okubategeeza kye basazeewo. Abasajja abaalondebwa nga bakulembeze mu Kkanisa baali: Yuda (era gwe bayita Balusaba) ne Siira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne baweebwa ebbaluwa gye baatwala ng'esoma bw'eti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pmo",
        "vid": "ACT 15:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ffe abatume, n'abakadde b'ekkanisa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pmo",
        "vid": "ACT 15:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eri abooluganda, mu Antiyokiya yonna ne Siriya ne Kirukiya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pmo",
        "vid": "ACT 15:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abooluganda tubalamusizza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuwulidde nti abamu ku booluganda baava wano ne bajja eyo nga si ffe tubatumye, ne boogera nammwe ebigambo ebyabatabulatabula mu kukkiriza kwammwe ne bibakeŋŋentereza emitima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyetuvudde tuteesa ffenna, era ne tukkiriziganya bumu, okubatumira ababaka baffe bajjire wamu n'abaagalwa baffe, Balunabba ne Pawulo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abasajja abeewaddeyo okuweereza Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo nga tebabalirira bulamu bwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tubatumidde Yuda ne Siira bongere okubannyonnyola n'akamwa ebyo ebiri mu bbaluwa eno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubanga kwe kuteesa kwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu, era naffe, nga tekisaanira kubatikka migugu gya bwereere egiteetaagibwa, wabula musaana okugoberera bino:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwewalenga ennyama ettiddwa olw'okuweebwayo eri bakatonda abalala, mwewalenga n'okulya omusaayi, era n'ennyama ey'ebisolo ebitugiddwa, era mwewalenga obwenzi. Bwe muneegendereza ne mwewala ebintu ebyo, munaaba mukoze bulungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pmc",
        "vid": "ACT 15:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mweraba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abaatumibwa ne basitula ne bagenda mu Antiyokiya, ne bakuŋŋaanya ekibiina ky'abakkiriza ne babakwasa ebbaluwa eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baagisoma, essanyu ne liba jjitirivu mu Kkanisa yonna olw'ebyo ebyagirimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yuda ne Siira, olwokubanga baali bannabbi, ne boogerera ebbanga ggwanvu nga bakubiriza abooluganda okunyweza okukkiriza kwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yuda ne Siira ne bamalayo ennaku ntonotono ne basiibula okuddayo eri abaabatuma. Abooluganda ne babatuma okulamusa abali mu Yerusaalemi n'okubeebaza olw'obubaka bwe baabaweereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Siira n'asalawo okusigalayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulo ne Balunabba ne babeera mu Antiyokiya okumala ebbanga nga bakolera wamu n'abalala nga babuuliira Enjiri era n'okuyigiriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pawulo ne Balunabba Baawukana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo nga wayiseewo ennaku Pawulo n'agamba Balunabba baddeyo mu bibuga gye baabuulira Enjiri, bagende nga bakyalira abooluganda, balabe nga bwe bali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balunabba n'akkiriza, wabula n'ayagala ne Yokaana Makko agende nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Pawulo ekyo n'atakyagala, kubanga Makko yabaawukanako n'abaleka e Panfuliya ng'omulimu ogwabatwala tebannagumaliriza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balemwa okukkiriziganya mu nsonga eyo, n'ekyavaamu kwe kwawukana. Balunabba n'atwala Makko ne basaabala ku nnyanja okulaga mu Kupulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pawulo n'alonda Siira, abooluganda ne bamusabira ekisa kya Mukama mu lugendo lwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bayita mu Siriya ne mu Kirukiya nga bagenda bagumya ekkanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
